# ── Copyrighted game data: NEVER committed ─────────────────────────────
# All extracted/derived Tomb Raider assets are build products generated
# from the user's own disc image (see README). Keep every byte of them
# out of the repository.
assets
assets/
*.bin
*.cof
*.rom
MUSIC.PCM
OPENLARA.COF

